NCT07795450.eligibility_criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Age ≥ 18 years, no gender restriction;
* ICU length of stay ≥ 24 hours (to ensure sufficient time-series monitoring data for model generation);
* Complete electronic health record data, including baseline demographic characteristics and at least one complete laboratory test record after ICU admission.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Patients who are transferred out or die within 24 hours of ICU admission;
* Duplicate admission records for non-initial ICU admissions (only the initial ICU admission record is retained to ensure independence);
* Severe deficiency in core data (e.g., absence of major vital sign recordings or \> 50% missing key laboratory test results);
* Patients with abandonment of treatment or discharge against medical advice, leading to inability to ascertain the definitive clinical outcome.

